    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Restaurant Tycoon: My Cooking Empire, where the kitchen is your kingdom, the clock is your toughest competitor, and your home is a reflection of your culinary success. Whether you\u2019re grilling burgers, rolling sushi, or flipping pancakes, each meal is a test of your speed, strategy, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 9 different cuisines to master and over 1000 levels to conquer, every day presents a fresh challenge. You\u2019ll craft 500+ unique dishes that push your skills to the limit, and with countless upgrades available, you can truly make every kitchen your own.\u00a0 But it\u2019s not just about the kitchens\u2014you\u2019ll also have your own home, where you can upgrade furniture and unlock trophies as you complete major game stages. Your home becomes a showcase of your achievements, growing and evolving as you progress through the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real challenge? Handling the pressure. Orders will pile up, customers will get impatient, and every decision counts. It\u2019s frantic, fun, and incredibly satisfying when everything falls into place.|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is easy to pick up but hard to master, delivering over a hundred hours of fast-paced, time-management bliss. Whether you're managing your kitchens or customizing your home, every decision makes your empire stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to prove that you have what it takes to become the ultimate Restaurant Tycoon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Cuisines to Master: From street food to sushi, each kitchen offers a fresh cooking style to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ Dishes: Serve up a menu packed with unique, challenging dishes from all over the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ Levels: Non-stop action as you manage increasingly complex kitchens and time-management challenges.A</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Kitchens &amp; Home: Upgrade ingredients, improve restaurant efficiency, and furnish your home with trophies and furniture upgrades as you advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Fun: Easy to dive into, but mastering the chaos will take time and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
